DEFAULT_MACRO SHAPEFILE_IN_SPATIAL_GROUP_SHAPEFILE_1 
GUI OPTIONAL DISCLOSUREGROUP SHAPEFILE_IN_SPATIAL_GROUP_SHAPEFILE_1 SHAPEFILE_IN_COORDINATE_SYSTEM_SHAPEFILE_1%SHAPEFILE_IN_DONUT_DETECTION_SHAPEFILE_1%SHAPEFILE_IN_MEASURES_AS_Z_SHAPEFILE_1%SHAPEFILE_IN_REPORT_BAD_GEOMETRY_SHAPEFILE_1%SHAPEFILE_IN_USE_SEARCH_ENVELOPE_SHAPEFILE_1 Spatial
