GUI CHOICE SHAPEFILE_IN_REPORT_BAD_GEOMETRY_SHAPEFILE_1 Yes%No Report Geometry Anomalies
DEFAULT_MACRO SHAPEFILE_IN_ADVANCED_SHAPEFILE_1 
